# Real device trace: portrait-vs-landscape page-turn comparison, 2026-07-30.
# os2 reader (2026-07-28 image), KOReader v2026.03, live over Wi-Fi SSH.
# Captured while an EBC-interrupt sampler ran concurrently at ~11 Hz, so every
# intent below is correlated with the exact number of hardware refresh passes
# it cost (doc/refresh-policy.md, "Portrait page turns cost two refresh passes").
